---
title: Coupling Middleman example
---

<main>
  <%= coupled_image_tag("images/logo.svg", alt: "Coupling logo", width: 120, height: 120) %>

  <h1>Coupling Middleman example</h1>
  <p>This page uses checked-in compiled assets without an asset bundler.</p>

  <h2>Ordered JavaScript outputs</h2>
  <ol>
    <% coupled_asset_paths("application.js").each do |path| %>
      <li><code><%= path %></code></li>
    <% end %>
  </ol>

  <p>Logo URL: <code><%= coupled_asset_path("images/logo.svg") %></code></p>
</main>
